 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "No crowd for «خير أمة»; stars on «السماوات» leave before the Name; a lamp for enjoining good; a seal for the covenant («بحبل»). Nothing drawn for the fighting (111), the humiliation or the killing of prophets (112). STAGING v4: 109 (Allah's dominion) is only a wide view of the town with stars that leave before the Name. 110: the believers of this ummah (b) enjoin good (speak), forbid wrong (shake_head) and raise their hands on «وتؤمنون»; 110:13-19 is counterfactual: the People of the Book only appear, nobody acts belief; 110:20-21 = two countable believers (q, Al-Muyassar: وهم قليل) appear only on 110:20 and sparkle; 110:22-23 = the larger group (k) turns away. 111-112 (fighting, humiliation, the killing of prophets) stay ambient; the seal plate for the covenant now ends on 112:14, before the anger and the humiliation."
 },
